    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoji, Shocking, SHOJING. </strong><br><br><strong>Break through, instinctively.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/a957f7da4558ba628b6afcde962b6498.poster.avif?t=1752460845\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/a957f7da4558ba628b6afcde962b6498.webm?t=1752460845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/a957f7da4558ba628b6afcde962b6498.mp4?t=1752460845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;SHOJING&quot; is a action game in which you control a cat and break shoji screens.   <br>Why not try breaking down those shoji screens to your heart's content, something that you're not allowed to break in the real world? <br>Good children and good cats, please do not copy this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/441a29a9b60b25200da66d3d36ac9828.poster.avif?t=1752460845\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/441a29a9b60b25200da66d3d36ac9828.webp?t=1752460845\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy operation with only mouse movement and left click. <br>Even those who do not usually play games and children can easily play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/9454f74fdb6bd541ddbbf2c1dbd50f04.poster.avif?t=1752460845\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/9454f74fdb6bd541ddbbf2c1dbd50f04.webm?t=1752460845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/9454f74fdb6bd541ddbbf2c1dbd50f04.mp4?t=1752460845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sound</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats jump and break shoji screens to the rhythm of the background music.<br>As you connect combos, the background music and game speed increase, and the exhilaration increases!<br>Get into the rhythm and break the shoji screens as fast as you can!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are easy to use, but the game requires serious maneuvering in order to achieve the perfect shoji-breaking.<br>Connect combos, avoid obstacles, and aim for a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/0af88b1a32831facbeb642f45b9d43c5.poster.avif?t=1752460845\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/0af88b1a32831facbeb642f45b9d43c5.webm?t=1752460845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/0af88b1a32831facbeb642f45b9d43c5.mp4?t=1752460845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by &quot;CRIWARE&quot;.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoji, Shocking, SHOJING. </strong><br><br><strong>Break through, instinctively.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/a957f7da4558ba628b6afcde962b6498.poster.avif?t=1752460845\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/a957f7da4558ba628b6afcde962b6498.webm?t=1752460845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/a957f7da4558ba628b6afcde962b6498.mp4?t=1752460845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;SHOJING&quot; is a action game in which you control a cat and break shoji screens.   <br>Why not try breaking down those shoji screens to your heart's content, something that you're not allowed to break in the real world? <br>Good children and good cats, please do not copy this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/441a29a9b60b25200da66d3d36ac9828.poster.avif?t=1752460845\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/441a29a9b60b25200da66d3d36ac9828.webp?t=1752460845\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy operation with only mouse movement and left click. <br>Even those who do not usually play games and children can easily play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171930/extras/9454f